        <p>DO YOU SUFFER FROM NEWRALGIA, if so why not try a bottle or H. M. ASHTON'S TIC AND NEURALGIA MIXTURE? It is a CEItTLIN CURE. You can obtain a Is. bottle by writing or sending to the only place in Warrington where it is prepared. SANKEY STREET PHARMACY 63, SANKEY-STREET, WARRINGTON.</p>
